# Util

Client-only pure helpers: `modules/{context}/utils/{name}.util.ts`. No React.

```ts
export function toOnboardingWorkspace(
  snapshot: FindOnboardingOutputDtoType,
): OnboardingWorkspace | null {
  if (!snapshot.organizationId || !snapshot.organizationName) return null;
  return {
    ...snapshot,
    organizationId: snapshot.organizationId,
    organizationName: snapshot.organizationName,
  };
}
```

## Shared with the server

A helper needed by both server and client lives on the server side; the client imports it. Never keep two copies.

| Used by                                    | Put it in                            | Client import           |
| ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------ | ----------------------- |
| Next server (layout, proxy) and the client | `apps/web/src/shared/{name}.util.ts` | `@/shared/...`          |
| `packages/server` and the client           | `packages/server`                    | `@workspace/server/...` |

A [hook](./hook.mdc) that only wraps a shared helper stays in the client and calls it.
